  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.egyptian.chariot_volley.description.2": "敌人越多，越可能向另一个目标追加一箭。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.egyptian.backstep.name": "后撤步",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.egyptian.backstep.description.1": "敌人靠近4格时向最安全的无碰撞方向跳跃5格。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.egyptian.backstep.description.2": "拥有2点充能，每6秒恢复1点，并齐射至多6个目标。",
