  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.armor_clad.name": "甲胄傍身",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.armor_clad.description.1": "受到的投射物伤害降低50%。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.armor_clad.description.2": "远程投射物造成的最终击退降低95%。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.growing_valor.name": "越战越勇",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.growing_valor.description.1": "每次有效挥击获得6%攻击力，最多叠加5层，持续8秒。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.growing_valor.description.2": "命中会刷新全部层数；同一挥击命中多人只增加1层。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.growing_valor.description.3": "生命越低最终减伤越高，濒死时最多30%；刀刃火焰随层数增强。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.crescent_blade.name": "偃月刀",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.crescent_blade.description.1": "普通攻击改为前方大范围扇形斩击。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.crescent_blade.description.2": "范围3.25格、角度220度，命中的所有敌人受到完整伤害。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.combo.name": "关刀连段招式",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.combo.description.1": "智能判断敌群或无法两刀击杀的强敌，并完整施展四段连招。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.combo.description.2": "四段伤害依次为70%、100%、70%、180%，全部为范围攻击。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.combo.description.3": "连招中向前推进3格，可平滑跨越一格高低差。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.combo.description.4": "第一段短暂浮空，第二段弹开正面来袭的敌方投射物。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.guandao.combo.description.5": "冷却12秒；每次实际受到近战或投射物伤害使冷却缩短0.5秒，减冷却不设上限。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.zanshin.name": "残心",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.zanshin.description.1": "生命越低闪避率越高：满血20%，1点生命时60%。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.zanshin.description.2": "每段有效攻击命中后1秒内额外获得20%闪避，重复命中只刷新，最终上限80%。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.zanshin.description.3": "成功闪避会取消整次伤害、击退与该次攻击新附加的状态，并获得1层踏込。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.zanshin.description.4": "燃烧、中毒、凋零、坠落等既有持续或环境伤害不能触发闪避。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.fumikomi.name": "踏込",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.fumikomi.description.1": "每5秒恢复1层充能，最多3层；成功闪避立即获得1层。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.fumikomi.description.2": "目标在普攻范围外且8格内时自动冲刺；成功接上攻击才消耗1层。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.fumikomi.description.3": "冲刺过程免疫伤害并保留重力，可平滑通过一格高低差，但不能穿墙或跨越悬崖。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.fumikomi.description.4": "目标已在普攻范围内、冲刺受阻或失去目标时保留充能。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.zan.name": "斩",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.zan.description.1": "普通攻击先进行90度小范围斩击：主目标100%，次要目标50%。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.zan.description.2": "第一刀后若160度扇区内仍有可见敌人，衔接第二刀并记录当时目标。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.zan.description.3": "第二刀主目标100%、次要目标50%；分支后才进入或隔墙出现的敌人不受伤。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.stab.name": "刺",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.stab.description.1": "自动施展，冷却10秒；起手要求目标在2.25格内且可见。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.stab.description.2": "刺入沿2.75格窄直线命中紧密排列的多个敌人，造成150%伤害。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.stab.description.3": "实际命中的目标短暂无法移动或攻击，以维持刺入演出。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.stab.description.4": "拔刀只结算最初命中的目标，造成300%伤害、普通轻击退并喷出鲜血粒子。",
  "gui.echo_warrior.summoner.skill.samurai.stab.description.5": "固定按模型原速播放，不受攻速影响；落空或目标提前死亡也会完整收势。",
